## What We Are Building

SandyStudio = AI animation studio (Next.js + Supabase + Inngest, local-first; webapp/). Тео = master-session orchestrator + Director's proxy to Polina (EXEC-CONC).

The big arc of this session: the video-generation subsystem kept failing live on E02 (missing image_url/seedance 422, stale anchors, plans firing on unapproved, multiple-approved-per-shot, regen 500). Root pathology (one cause, ~20 defects): the codebase learned "no silent fallback" ONCE (TD-78, VGEN prompt path) and applied it surgically; every defect is that lesson un-applied one layer over (reference-byte loading, provider results, regen routes, dispatch gating, budget, idempotency, observability).

The fix is the **Gate-Hardening RFC** → `docs/RFC-2026-06-04-gate-hardening-video-pipeline.md` (READ THIS FIRST on resume). 10 invariants, 2 layers (L-I Integrity+Money, L-II Process+Quality), 3 phases. Director approved q23a→Phase1, then Phase2, then Phase3(all). Director delegated FULL autonomous execution ("делаешь всё сам, решения по ходу сам, без меня, ===5==="), with one hard gate: **paid Veo/Seedance live-smoke only TOGETHER with Director** ("смок потом запустим вместе").

