## What WORKED (with evidence)

**Phase 1 — SHIPPED, verified green, applied to prod DB. HEAD=7c76a05, 17 commits ahead of origin (NOT pushed).**
- **Single-approved invariant (I2)** — generalized auto-demote→**INVALIDATED** on approve across 6 slot families (IMG-anchor/IMG-episode_ref/SPC-shot_plan/VID-shot/SPC-ref_plan/SBL) in approve/route.ts + **DB partial-unique-indexes** migration `0036` (applied). Confirmed: dedup of 28 historical duplicates ran clean, then 0036 index creation succeeded (= no duplicate-approved remained).
- **Loud Drive-aware media resolution (I3)** — one canonical reader path; `readBibleImageAsBase64` /staging-only → readAssetMediaAsBase64 in regen routes (THE fix for the Director's regen-video 500); `ReferenceLoadError`+`loadApprovedMediaOrThrow` in vgen-shot-helpers; new `webapp/lib/agents/media-preflight.ts` (`assertMediaResolves`) wired into gate.ts validateAgentInputs (with mock-mode skip: `if (!process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY?.trim()) return null`).
- **Money safety (I7)** — migration `0037` atomic `increment_budget_spent` RPC (applied); `assertBudgetAvailable` pre-spend check in runner.ts EXEC-VGEN BEFORE provider.generate; `budget_reserved_usd` reservation reconciled via `reservedUsd` in exec-vgen.ts's 2 record-cost steps (NO double-charge); mock-supabase `.rpc` stub added.
- **Verify trio:** tsc·0 · vitest 658/658 · replay-pilot 30/30 (at 7c76a05).
- **Live validation in Polina's env:** her `updateWorkPlan` works (durable work-plan alive); `agent_failed` "Media unreachable" now VISIBLE to her (observability for factory agents); the dedup auto-removed the unreachable duplicate anchor cdf7f959 (SH15-start-v01, drive=NULL) that was blocking Video Designer → block gone.

**Earlier 2026-06-03 work (commits c7f0cc7..f720e45, also in the 17):** Polina durable work-plan STATE asset; media perf (sharp thumbnails/cache headers/onError); activity_events constraint migration 0035; anchor description body; anchor image_prompt backfill (51); chat-internal `source:'timer'` fix; animatic-in-anchor-mode (gate + builder + empty-state); animatic builder newest-version + episode_ref fallback + metadata-shot_id match; anchor auto-demote; approve-route approved-plan gate (q18); vgen media-loader Drive-aware (q20).

