## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Workflow-tool worktree STALE BASE (critical trap, hit twice):** `agent(..., isolation:'worktree')` branches worktrees from **origin/master (625e9b2)**, NOT local HEAD. Since the 17 commits are local-unpushed, every worktree was "missing" them → diffstat showed −355 work-plan.ts, −168 animatic, etc. Blind cherry-pick/merge would REVERT the day's work. RESOLUTION: do NOT merge worktree branches; instead `cp` safe files (new + files-unchanged-today) and MANUALLY port (via parallel main-tree subagents, no worktree) the files changed both today and by a unit. For Phase 2: either `git push` first (so worktree base = HEAD) OR run subagents in the MAIN tree on disjoint files (no worktree) — the latter worked cleanly for the 5 Phase-1 ports.
- **U3 (money) was PARTIAL:** I8 (split provider.generate into its own Inngest step separate from persist → so retry doesn't re-spend) NOT done — it requires refactoring exec-vgen.ts + runner.ts EXEC-VGEN return shape (runAgent has no Inngest `step` handle). Carried to Phase 2.
- **media-preflight is episode-WIDE, not shot-scoped:** gate `validateAgentInputs` has no `shotId` (args = supabase/agentId/episodeId/eventContext). So for EXEC-VANIM/VGEN it checks ALL episode anchors → one bad approved anchor would block the whole stage. Currently 0 unreachable so not blocking. Phase-2: thread shotId into the gate to scope it.
- **Paid Veo/Seedance live-smoke** — deliberately NOT auto-fired (money gate; Director: do it together).

---

## What Has NOT Been Tried Yet (Phase 2, then Phase 3)

**Phase 2 (process) — heavy SEQUENTIAL refactor of runner.ts + exec-vgen.ts (all 3 pieces converge on runner.ts → NOT cleanly parallel):**
- **Fold hand-rolled VGEN/EREF handlers into the factory-gated path** (`execVgenStart`, `execVgenSingleShot` in exec-vgen.ts:157/493; `execErefStart` exec-eref.ts:43 bypass `validateAgentInputs`+`enforceMode`+`agent_failed`). Folding gives I4 gate-universality + I8 step-split (no double-generate on retry) + `agent_failed` observability for free.
- **Generalized auto-bounce critic-loop** (q25 APPROVED): extract GAGAD HALT mechanic (runner.ts ~1122-1189) into `webapp/lib/agents/critic-loop.ts` `applyCriticVerdict({verdict,planAssetId,cap,actor})`; wire VPREV/EPREV/SREV; enable in Mode 1; cap=2→HALT→Director Inbox. Removes Director as first defect-router. Update specs/protocols/qa_retry.md + glossary.
- **Provider contract self-enforcement (I5):** add `requires_reference_image` to VideoProviderCapabilities → seedance img2vid throws at provider boundary if no image; resolve provider FIRST then derive clamps/aspect/duration from caps (runner.ts pre-clamps to 8 + 3-value aspect BEFORE provider — bug); plan authoritative over event args; unknown provider vocab = REVISE not silent default.
- **media-preflight shot-scoping** (thread shotId into gate).
- **SBL single-LOCKED demote at lock-route** (approve route never sets LOCKED; the lock happens elsewhere, likely app/api/assets/[id]/route.ts PATCH — add demoteSiblingApproved-equivalent there; 0036 index + dedup already cover it as safety net).

**Phase 3 (output):** OUTPUT-critic — `output-critic-core.ts` + `frame-sampler.ts` (ffmpeg→N frames→1 vision call) + EXEC-VGEN-CRITIC (reuse critic-loop). q26 (sync vs async) decide on live smoke. Plus deterministic camera-orbit check + quality_tier↔shot_role check (V14) in animator-critic.ts; kill hardcoded `'fast'` defaults.

